==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Chief Peng]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[CTO Seal]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is relatively simple: all you need is a few meatshields, a good attacker, and [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]]. The starting Chief Pengs are quite easy to stall due to their lack of health allowing you to build up a ton of money. On base hit, iCat will freeze (Permafreeze if you bring a freeze up [[Cat Combo|Combo]]) the Bore, letting your attackers freely chip away at it. With Bore gone, all that remains is CTO Seal which can be stalled with a few meatshields and defeated with ranged attackers such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]].

